{
  "retrieved": "2026-10-23",
  "upstream": "shadcn-ui/ui",
  "style": "base-nova",
  "license": "NOTICE",
  "adaptations": [
    "Reuse the initial 18 Corner/Base UI controls from src/primitives.tsx; new sourced controls call their public APIs.",
    "New current base-nova controls retain Tailwind v4 utility composition. src/utilities-only.css owns source discovery and Corner semantic mappings; src/utilities.css adds Preflight for full adoption. The light semantic theme can be scoped with .corner-ui for legacy consumers.",
    "Existing Corner light and dark color values adjusted from the requester-provided CSS reference, retaining token names, flat fills without shadows, and visible focus outlines. No extra token names or component rules were added; shared surfaces use the existing background token.",
    "Lucide icons replace registry icon placeholders; cn uses clsx and tailwind-merge.",
    "Sidebar uses the 760px product breakpoint, protects editable shortcuts, and forwards explicit phone initial/final focus. Search expands collapsed desktop navigation before focusing; every phone opening resets cancellation focus. The app disables the extra Sheet close button.",
    "Calendar day sizing, selected states, and day-button keyboard-focus refs adapt to the existing Corner Button API. Menubar declares its own inset prop. Chart axis-label selectors match Recharts 3.8's actual tick-value class so light/dark semantic text colors apply.",
    "Base UI Toaster accepts viewportProps for portal theme scoping without replacing its shared composition. Toasts use flat borderless fills and the shared floating shadow; action controls use tonal fills.",
    "Form is a native form composed with Field; the current form registry item has no source files. Data Table uses the current TanStack Table v9 recipe.",
    "Conversation specimens use explicit local-only content, not an AI transport. Code Block previews terminal output without a copy control.",
    "Combobox's composed icon trigger and clear control have accessible default labels; catalog Slider and Resizable examples use explicit labels.",
    "The browser UI package explicitly declares React/ReactDOM ambient types, avoiding unrelated ancestor type-library leakage in clean installations.",
    "The first 18 controls retain project-owned compact APIs, not exact upstream API parity. Alert success/warning and dark theme are Corner extensions."
  ],
